 0829   0596    rules:
 082C   0596            CLS
 082C   0596            WIDTH 80
 082C   0596            PRINT " Welcome to the premier point and click game by 
                Kreuzer productions"
 082C   0596            PRINT " The point and click interface is really quite e
                asy. Move the green"
 082C   0596            PRINT " cursor onto the object you want to manipulate a
                nd press one of "
 082C   0596            PRINT " these keys. (a) for action . (l) to look at an 
                object. Type (u) to"
 082C   0596            PRINT " use th active object. (g) to get that object.(n
                ote) some objects you"
 082C   0596            PRINT " must look at to get or you must look at the dra
                wer to find the object "
 082C   0596            PRINT " inside. Also at any time during the game you ma
                y press (i) to display "
 082C   0596            PRINT " the your inventory ,time and place. Plus you ma
                y load,save or quit"
 082C   0596            PRINT " or select the active object from this screen. "
 082C   0596            PRINT " if you seem to be stuck it would be wise to bac
                ktrack and look to see if"
 082C   0596            PRINT " you anything new has opened up or one of your o
                bjects has a use in that"
 082C   0596            PRINT " room. If action does not work on something you 
                might try look or get or"
 082C   0596            PRINT " vice versa, also try clicking the cursor on dif
                ferent parts of the object"
 082C   0596            PRINT " it might reveal different things. "
